[ext_resource type="Texture3D" path="res://textures/fog-density-volume-half.tres" id="1_density"]

; unit-fog-volume-density-volume-tres with an ImageTexture3D in the RHalf format: 8 slices of
; 16x16 whose density runs from 0 to 2.5, written by Godot 4.6.3
; (textures/fog-density-volume-half.tres). The variable is a float density past 1. Every other
; density texture holds bytes, which stop at 1, so a regression in the float decode or the float
; density stack shows nowhere else.

